.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH history 1  "history " 
.SH NAME
history \- Show a cloud snippet\*(Aqs version history (versions are immutable; local\-only snippets have none)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhistory\fR [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a cloud snippet\*(Aqs version history (versions are immutable; local\-only snippets have none)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 50]
How many versions to list at most
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
Snippet reference: name or owner/name
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg history ubuntu\-setup
  fg history anna/ubuntu\-setup
